## Development flow

`bun run dev` starts the Worker locally with Wrangler. Use `bun run build` to
bundle without deploying, `bun run deploy` to publish, and `bun run cf-typegen`
after changing bindings in `wrangler.jsonc`.

## Service boundaries

- Keep the default export in `src/index.ts` compatible with the Workers module
  format.
- Express request work as Effect programs and run them at the Hono handler
  boundary.
- Define Worker bindings in `wrangler.jsonc`, regenerate their types, and pass
  `CloudflareBindings` to Hono when the service starts using bindings.
